      "revision": 1287535137,
      "text": "Albizia amara is a tree in the family Fabaceae. Its range includes southern and Eastern Africa, from South Africa to Sudan and Ethiopia. It is also found in India and Sri Lanka."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Albizia amara",
